flowchart TD
MOOOptimizer["**MOO Optimizer**<br/>Attributes - population_size generations seeds<br/>Methods - optimize initialize_population evaluate select crossover mutate archive_pareto"] 
Population["**Population**<br/>Attributes - individuals list size_current<br/>Methods - create_random evaluate_all replace_elite"] 
Individual["**Individual**<br/>Attributes - buffer_capacities PostLoadingBuffer PostConveyorBuffer PostWashingBuffer PrePress1Buffer PrePress2Buffer PostPress12Buffer {1-3 each}<br/>Methods - encode decode mutate crossover evaluate"] 
Constraints["**Constraints**<br/>Attributes - capacity_range {1-3} discrete<br/>Methods - enforce validate_config"] 
SimulationRunner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>Attributes - seeds warmup measure_until runs parallel_evals<br/>Methods - apply_config run_simulation collect_metrics"] 
SimulationModel["**Simulation Model Adapter**<br/>Depends on - existing run_simulation function<br/>Attributes - mapping of buffer names to DelayBuffer cap values<br/>Methods - set_buffer_caps start_env return_raw_metrics"] 
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer Class**<br/>Attributes - cap delay tokens store in_transit<br/>Methods - put get free_capacity in_transit_count"] 
MachineClass["**Machine Class**<br/>Attributes - name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_time failed_time processed_count active_count<br/>Methods - run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy working_energy reset_stats"] 
MetricsCalculator["**Metrics Calculator**<br/>Inputs - raw simulation output<br/>Outputs - throughput wip produced_parts machine_energy bottleneck_data<br/>Methods - compute_objectives aggregate_stats"] 
Evaluation["**Evaluation**<br/>Attributes - objective_functions throughput_maximize wip_minimize<br/>Methods - compute_fitness pareto_nondominated rank_and_crowding"] 
Selection["**Selection Operator**<br/>Methods - tournament_selection pareto_selection"] 
Crossover["**Crossover Operator**<br/>Methods - uniform_crossover one_point_crossover produce_offspring"] 
Mutation["**Mutation Operator**<br/>Methods - random_mutation discrete_increment_decrement respect_constraints"] 
Archive["**Pareto Archive**<br/>Attributes - nondominated_set size_limit<br/>Methods - update_store export_results"] 
StopCriteria["**Stop Criteria**<br/>Attributes - max_generations no_improvement_limit time_budget<br/>Methods - check_stop"] 
Results["**Optimization Results**<br/>Attributes - pareto_front solutions metrics history<br/>Methods - export_json report_table"] 

MOOOptimizer --> Population
MOOOptimizer --> Constraints
Population --> Individual
Individual --> Constraints
MOOOptimizer --> SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner --> SimulationModel
SimulationModel --> DelayBufferClass
SimulationModel --> MachineClass
SimulationRunner --> MetricsCalculator
MetricsCalculator --> Evaluation
Evaluation --> MOOOptimizer
MOOOptimizer --> Selection
MOOOptimizer --> Crossover
MOOOptimizer --> Mutation
Selection --> Crossover
Crossover --> Mutation
Mutation --> Population
MOOOptimizer --> Archive
Evaluation --> Archive
Archive --> Results
MOOOptimizer --> StopCriteria
StopCriteria --> MOOOptimizer

%% Interaction flow for one generation
Population -->|sample candidate config| SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner -->|apply buffer caps| SimulationModel
SimulationModel -->|invoke run_simulation| MachineClass
SimulationModel -->|invoke run_simulation| DelayBufferClass
SimulationRunner -->|return raw metrics| MetricsCalculator
MetricsCalculator -->|throughput and wip| Evaluation
Evaluation -->|fitness and dominance| MOOOptimizer

%% Notes on discrete inputs and objectives
Constraints -->|enforce discrete range| Individual
Evaluation -->|objectives throughput maximize wip minimize| MOOOptimizer

%% Archive and output
MOOOptimizer -->|update pareto set| Archive
Archive -->|final pareto front| Results